  {
   "id": "bl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 378,
   "width": 573,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100010,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700070,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Assignment is a pure function over a FROZEN definition",
   "originalText": "Assignment is a pure function over a FROZEN definition",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "asn",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 416,
   "width": 940,
   "height": 130,
   "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
   "backgroundColor": "#1e293b",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100011,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700077,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "asn_t",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "asn_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 38,
   "y": 436,
   "width": 924,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100012,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700084,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "HashBucketAssigner.assign(experimentId, userId, experimentDef):\n    bucket = hash(experimentDef.salt + ':' + experimentId + ':' + userId) % 100\n    for variant in experimentDef.variants:      # ordered, FROZEN at start\n        if variant.bucketStart <= bucket < variant.bucketEnd:\n            return variant.key\n    return 'control'                            # defensive, never an error",
   "originalText": "HashBucketAssigner.assign(experimentId, userId, experimentDef):\n    bucket = hash(experimentDef.salt + ':' + experimentId + ':' + userId) % 100\n    for variant in experimentDef.variants:      # ordered, FROZEN at start\n        if variant.bucketStart <= bucket < variant.bucketEnd:\n            return variant.key\n    return 'control'                            # defensive, never an error",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "asn",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 416,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100013,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700091,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The per-experiment SALT is what keeps one user's bucketing independent across\ndifferent experiments. Without it, hash(experimentId + userId) for two\nexperiments with similar id structure could correlate more than chance alone\nwould explain - and correlated assignment across experiments quietly invalidates\nboth of them.",
   "originalText": "The per-experiment SALT is what keeps one user's bucketing independent across\ndifferent experiments. Without it, hash(experimentId + userId) for two\nexperiments with similar id structure could correlate more than chance alone\nwould explain - and correlated assignment across experiments quietly invalidates\nboth of them.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 510,
   "width": 591,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100014,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700098,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The variants and their bucket ranges come from the snapshot taken when the\nexperiment STARTED. This function never consults a live, editable config - the\nsame reason a feature flag's evaluator never re-derives its rollout math from a\nconfig that could change mid-evaluation.",
   "originalText": "The variants and their bucket ranges come from the snapshot taken when the\nexperiment STARTED. This function never consults a live, editable config - the\nsame reason a feature flag's evaluator never re-derives its rollout math from a\nconfig that could change mid-evaluation.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
