   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "an exposure event claims a variant the hash does not agree with",
   "originalText": "an exposure event claims a variant the hash does not agree with",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "erd0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1428,
   "width": 919,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100041,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700287,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "never trust the variant a client-supplied exposure event carries. assign() is recomputed SERVER-SIDE from (experimentId,\nuserId) and compared against the logged variant before the exposure is accepted. A mismatch - a stale client cache, a\ntampered request - is dropped rather than silently corrupting a variant's summary with a user who was never assigned to it.",
   "originalText": "never trust the variant a client-supplied exposure event carries. assign() is recomputed SERVER-SIDE from (experimentId,\nuserId) and compared against the logged variant before the exposure is accepted. A mismatch - a stale client cache, a\ntampered request - is dropped rather than silently corrupting a variant's summary with a user who was never assigned to it.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
